From b7b8a37fce886a761814d5375d2922e6dd99e8cd Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: EscapeA <escapea@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sat, 14 Nov 2026 12:22:11 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] fix(0.8.22-adapt): stitch plugin navigation into fork rail,
 drop apiRelay locale keys

- App.vue: merge hasMobileContextSidebar into a single expression
  (usesPluginSidebar || !APP_SIDEBAR_ROUTES), removing the duplicated
  condition line the union merge produced.
- StudioNavigationRail.vue: keep upstream 0.8.22 plugin entries
  (pluginEntries/pluginActive/pluginPageLocation) while restoring the
  fork labeled / withAppEntries / toggle-labels props.
- PageSidebarNav.vue: take the custom-next target (connections entry
  stays removed, history toggle preserved).
- locales: drop the apiRelay top-level key the union merge resurrected
  in 11 locale files (view/controller/router already removed).
